WEBVTT

00:00:19.958 --> 00:00:22.041
<c.Caption-C2_1>Merry Popotan

00:00:22.250 --> 00:00:25.916
<c.Caption-C3_1>Mii's Place

00:01:39.000 --> 00:01:40.583
<c.Subtitle-C2_1>Ow!

00:01:40.625 --> 00:01:41.500
<c.Subtitle-C3_1>Who is it?

00:01:41.916 --> 00:01:43.583
<c.Subtitle-C4_1>Mii?

00:01:44.416 --> 00:01:46.958
<c.Subtitle-C5_1>It's dangerous to run

00:01:44.417 --> 00:01:46.958
<c.Subtitle-C5_2>down the hallway like that.

00:02:08.416 --> 00:02:09.291
<c.Subtitle-C6_1>Huh?

00:02:12.208 --> 00:02:13.583
<c.Subtitle-C7_1>Oh, my.

00:02:16.125 --> 00:02:17.666
<c.Subtitle-C8_1>Are you all right?

00:02:19.666 --> 00:02:22.875
<c.Subtitle-C9_1>Who are you, anyway?

00:02:28.166 --> 00:02:30.333
<c.Subtitle-C10_1>What is it, Ai?!

00:02:37.125 --> 00:02:39.375
<c.Subtitle-C11_1>Ow.

00:02:49.416 --> 00:02:51.125
<c.Subtitle-C12_1>It's puffy!

00:02:51.125 --> 00:02:53.958
<c.Subtitle-C13_1>Puffy! Puffy!

00:02:54.000 --> 00:02:56.625
<c.Subtitle-C14_1>Is he your friend, Mii?

00:03:00.666 --> 00:03:04.666
<c.Subtitle-C15_1>Please walk quietly in the house.

00:03:07.250 --> 00:03:08.625
<c.Subtitle-C16_1>I'm home!

00:03:11.208 --> 00:03:12.875
<c.Subtitle-C17_1>What are you doing, Mii?

00:03:16.166 --> 00:03:21.125
<c.Caption-C4_1>The Secret House

00:03:21.875 --> 00:03:24.875
<c.Subtitle-C18_1>You came to take pictures of ghosts?

00:03:25.541 --> 00:03:26.708
<c.Subtitle-C19_1>Yeah.

00:03:26.750 --> 00:03:30.083
<c.Subtitle-C20_1>I mean, this house looks like

00:03:26.751 --> 00:03:30.083
<c.Subtitle-C20_2>a haunted house...

00:03:30.083 --> 00:03:33.583
<c.Subtitle-C21_1>...and no one seems to know

00:03:30.084 --> 00:03:33.583
<c.Subtitle-C21_2>who lives here.

00:03:35.541 --> 00:03:36.666
<c.Subtitle-C22_1>And...

00:03:37.208 --> 00:03:38.041
<c.Subtitle-C23_1>Look! Look!

00:03:38.041 --> 00:03:40.458
<c.Subtitle-C24_1>I've got one, too, Puffy Cheeks!

00:03:40.500 --> 00:03:42.541
<c.Subtitle-C25_1>Haunted house, huh?

00:03:42.541 --> 00:03:45.458
<c.Subtitle-C26_1>I guess that's what people would think.

00:03:45.500 --> 00:03:46.875
<c.Subtitle-C27_1>You see...

00:03:46.916 --> 00:03:48.541
<c.Subtitle-C28_1>...we really liked the location...

00:03:48.541 --> 00:03:52.333
<c.Subtitle-C29_1>...so we had this house built

00:03:48.542 --> 00:03:52.333
<c.Subtitle-C29_2>in a real hurry.

00:03:52.666 --> 00:03:53.833
<c.Subtitle-C30_1>Right.

00:03:54.250 --> 00:03:55.791
<c.Subtitle-C31_1>So, there are no ghosts.

00:03:57.000 --> 00:03:59.916
<c.Subtitle-C32_1>Just like me! Just like me!

00:03:57.001 --> 00:03:59.916
<c.Subtitle-C32_2>Puffy Cheeks!

00:04:00.291 --> 00:04:03.083
<c.Subtitle-C33_1>Anyway, you mustn't sneak

00:04:00.292 --> 00:04:03.083
<c.Subtitle-C33_2>into people's houses.

00:04:03.083 --> 00:04:04.916
<c.Subtitle-C34_1>And you saw my sister naked!

00:04:04.958 --> 00:04:06.666
<c.Subtitle-C35_1>This is a crime, you know!

00:04:07.500 --> 00:04:08.333
<c.Subtitle-C36_1>Illegal entry.

00:04:09.291 --> 00:04:10.625
<c.Subtitle-C37_1>In this case...

00:04:10.625 --> 00:04:14.083
<c.Subtitle-C38_1>...you could also be charged

00:04:10.626 --> 00:04:14.083
<c.Subtitle-C38_2>with assault on a female.

00:04:15.250 --> 00:04:17.708
<c.Subtitle-C39_1>A-Anyway, you're a boy.

00:04:17.750 --> 00:04:20.875
<c.Subtitle-C40_1>You should know it's wrong

00:04:17.751 --> 00:04:20.875
<c.Subtitle-C40_2>to sneak in on naked girls.

00:04:20.875 --> 00:04:22.375
<c.Subtitle-C41_1>Now, apologize.

00:04:22.500 --> 00:04:24.000
<c.Subtitle-C42_1>It's all right.

00:04:24.291 --> 00:04:26.625
<c.Subtitle-C43_1>There was no harm done.

00:04:26.666 --> 00:04:28.666
<c.Subtitle-C44_1>Good thing there was no harm.

00:04:29.458 --> 00:04:30.500
<c.Subtitle-C45_1>I'm sorry.

00:04:36.125 --> 00:04:37.458
<c.Subtitle-C46_1>Oh, right.

00:04:37.500 --> 00:04:39.958
<c.Subtitle-C47_1>We haven't been introduced.

00:04:40.000 --> 00:04:42.000
<c.Subtitle-C48_1>Well, my name is Ai.

00:04:42.000 --> 00:04:44.166
<c.Subtitle-C49_1>And my younger sister is Mai.

00:04:44.500 --> 00:04:45.250
<c.Subtitle-C50_1>Hi.

00:04:45.541 --> 00:04:47.916
<c.Subtitle-C51_1>And my youngest sister is Mii.

00:04:48.166 --> 00:04:49.708
<c.Subtitle-C52_1>Call me Mii!

00:04:49.708 --> 00:04:51.083
<c.Subtitle-C53_1>Okay, Puffy Cheeks?

00:04:51.625 --> 00:04:54.958
<c.Subtitle-C54_1>And this is Mea, our maid.

00:04:55.250 --> 00:04:56.708
<c.Subtitle-C55_1>I am Mea.

00:04:57.000 --> 00:04:59.125
<c.Subtitle-C56_1>I have prepared some tea.

00:05:00.083 --> 00:05:02.250
<c.Subtitle-C57_1>Come on, Unagi.

00:05:00.084 --> 00:05:02.250
<c.Subtitle-C57_2>Introduce yourself.

00:05:04.916 --> 00:05:06.875
<c.Subtitle-C58_1>This is Unagi, the ferret.

00:05:08.833 --> 00:05:10.291
<c.Subtitle-C59_1>No, Unagi!

00:05:10.291 --> 00:05:13.291
<c.Subtitle-C60_1>This is my Puffy Cheeks!

00:05:13.958 --> 00:05:16.500
<c.Subtitle-C61_1>I am not your Puffy Cheeks. I'm Daichi.

00:05:16.541 --> 00:05:17.333
<c.Subtitle-C62_1>Daichi?

00:05:17.333 --> 00:05:19.000
<c.Subtitle-C63_1>Daichi, huh?

00:05:19.333 --> 00:05:23.875
<c.Subtitle-C64_1>Well, could you tell us exactly

00:05:19.334 --> 00:05:23.875
<c.Subtitle-C64_2>what you were doing here?

00:05:25.625 --> 00:05:28.166
<c.Subtitle-C65_1>You must've had a reason...

00:05:28.208 --> 00:05:31.083
<c.Subtitle-C66_1>...to come and take pictures of ghosts.

00:05:31.125 --> 00:05:31.833
<c.Subtitle-C67_1>Yeah.

00:05:40.875 --> 00:05:42.791
<c.Subtitle-C68_1>There's no such thing! No way!

00:05:43.458 --> 00:05:47.166
<c.Subtitle-C69_1>My dad told me not to believe in that.

00:05:47.875 --> 00:05:49.875
<c.Subtitle-C70_1>My grandma told me, too.

00:05:50.041 --> 00:05:53.125
<c.Subtitle-C71_1>That everyone who dies goes to Heaven.

00:05:54.041 --> 00:05:56.208
<c.Subtitle-C72_1>But I feel that they exist.

00:05:56.250 --> 00:05:58.583
<c.Subtitle-C73_1>But can you prove it?

00:05:59.083 --> 00:06:00.375
<c.Subtitle-C74_1>Well...

00:06:00.833 --> 00:06:03.291
<c.Subtitle-C75_1>There are no ghosts.

00:06:03.333 --> 00:06:04.458
<c.Subtitle-C76_1>That's right.

00:06:06.375 --> 00:06:10.208
<c.Subtitle-C77_1>So, if I had a picture of a ghost

00:06:06.376 --> 00:06:10.208
<c.Subtitle-C77_2>that would be proof.

00:06:10.375 --> 00:06:13.041
<c.Subtitle-C78_1>I thought that would make Asuka happy.

00:06:14.791 --> 00:06:16.041
<c.Subtitle-C79_1>I see. I see.

00:06:16.083 --> 00:06:17.750
<c.Subtitle-C80_1>So, in other words...

00:06:17.791 --> 00:06:20.500
<c.Subtitle-C81_1>...you really like this Asuka girl?

00:06:20.541 --> 00:06:23.500
<c.Subtitle-C82_1>Did you kiss her? Well? Well?

00:06:20.542 --> 00:06:23.500
<c.Subtitle-C82_2>Did you kiss her?

00:06:23.708 --> 00:06:24.666
<c.Subtitle-C83_1>Kiss?

00:06:24.666 --> 00:06:26.583
<c.Subtitle-C84_1>Kiss! You know. Kiss!

00:06:26.625 --> 00:06:27.958
<c.Subtitle-C85_1>Enough, Mii!

00:06:28.375 --> 00:06:30.541
<c.Subtitle-C86_1>You just shut your mouth, Mii!

00:06:30.541 --> 00:06:31.541
<c.Subtitle-C87_1>Kiss.

00:06:31.916 --> 00:06:34.791
<c.Subtitle-C88_1>I-It's not like I like her or anything.

00:06:35.083 --> 00:06:37.291
<c.Subtitle-C89_1>It's just that, well...

00:06:38.250 --> 00:06:39.541
<c.Subtitle-C90_1>I understand.

00:06:40.083 --> 00:06:42.458
<c.Subtitle-C91_1>Now, let's get that picture of a ghost.

00:06:46.125 --> 00:06:47.500
<c.Subtitle-C92_1>Here goes!

00:06:50.291 --> 00:06:51.958
<c.Subtitle-C93_1>Creepy, creepy!

00:06:52.083 --> 00:06:53.666
<c.Subtitle-C94_1>Creepy, creepy!

00:06:54.875 --> 00:06:56.208
<c.Subtitle-C95_1>How's this?

00:06:58.000 --> 00:06:59.541
<c.Subtitle-C96_1>Well, uh, I don't know.

00:07:00.250 --> 00:07:03.666
<c.Subtitle-C97_1>Too gentle a face for a ghost.

00:07:04.041 --> 00:07:05.333
<c.Subtitle-C98_1>You think?

00:07:05.541 --> 00:07:08.208
<c.Subtitle-C99_1>We can take a picture of Mai.

00:07:08.208 --> 00:07:09.958
<c.Subtitle-C100_1>There's no gentleness in her.

00:07:10.250 --> 00:07:10.916
<c.Subtitle-C101_1>Ow, ow, ow!

00:07:10.916 --> 00:07:13.416
<c.Subtitle-C102_1>Oh, my hands are doing this

00:07:10.917 --> 00:07:13.416
<c.Subtitle-C102_2>on their own!

00:07:14.416 --> 00:07:17.291
<c.Subtitle-C103_1>Then, how about we ask Mea?

00:07:17.541 --> 00:07:18.833
<c.Subtitle-C104_1>Very well.

00:07:21.458 --> 00:07:24.833
<c.Subtitle-C105_1>Creepy, creepy!

00:07:25.583 --> 00:07:27.333
<c.Subtitle-C106_1>Creepy!

00:07:31.208 --> 00:07:33.375
<c.Subtitle-C107_1>She almost seems too real.

00:07:35.500 --> 00:07:37.625
<c.Subtitle-C108_1>I'm actually getting scared.

00:07:37.666 --> 00:07:39.333
<c.Subtitle-C109_1>Yes.

00:07:49.083 --> 00:07:50.375
<c.Subtitle-C110_1>Hurry up and take it.

00:07:51.791 --> 00:07:53.041
<c.Subtitle-C111_1>Uh, right.

00:07:59.750 --> 00:08:00.500
<c.Subtitle-C112_1>Cool!

00:08:00.500 --> 00:08:01.583
<c.Subtitle-C113_1>Is that a real ghost?!

00:08:01.625 --> 00:08:03.166
<c.Subtitle-C114_1>It's a ghost!

00:08:03.166 --> 00:08:04.083
<c.Subtitle-C115_1>Another one here!

00:08:04.083 --> 00:08:06.666
<c.Subtitle-C116_1>See. I told you that there are ghosts!

00:08:06.666 --> 00:08:07.625
<c.Subtitle-C117_1>See? See?

00:08:07.666 --> 00:08:08.333
<c.Subtitle-C118_1>Right.

00:08:08.375 --> 00:08:09.583
<c.Subtitle-C119_1>But...

00:08:09.625 --> 00:08:11.541
<c.Subtitle-C120_1>I know! Daichi!

00:08:11.541 --> 00:08:14.291
<c.Subtitle-C121_1>Where did you take these?

00:08:14.458 --> 00:08:15.708
<c.Subtitle-C122_1>At the abandoned house on the hill.

00:08:15.750 --> 00:08:17.291
<c.Subtitle-C123_1>Really? But how?

00:08:18.250 --> 00:08:21.125
<c.Subtitle-C124_1>Um, I sneaked in...

00:08:21.125 --> 00:08:23.250
<c.Subtitle-C125_1>...and just started shooting.

00:08:23.291 --> 00:08:24.875
<c.Subtitle-C126_1>And they just came out on film?

00:08:24.916 --> 00:08:25.958
<c.Subtitle-C127_1>Y-Yeah.

00:08:25.958 --> 00:08:27.416
<c.Subtitle-C128_1>Right.

00:08:27.458 --> 00:08:29.458
<c.Subtitle-C129_1>So ghosts really do exist!

00:08:29.500 --> 00:08:30.333
<c.Subtitle-C130_1>Uh, yeah.

00:08:31.583 --> 00:08:32.791
<c.Subtitle-C131_1>Good.

00:08:41.125 --> 00:08:43.375
<c.Subtitle-C132_1>They've all gone out.

00:08:43.708 --> 00:08:46.875
<c.Subtitle-C133_1>Huh? Ai isn't here?

00:08:47.250 --> 00:08:48.375
<c.Subtitle-C134_1>No, she isn't.

00:08:48.750 --> 00:08:49.750
<c.Subtitle-C135_1>Where did they go?

00:08:50.541 --> 00:08:51.625
<c.Subtitle-C136_1>How would I know?

00:08:52.583 --> 00:08:54.375
<c.Subtitle-C137_1>If you'll excuse me.

00:09:17.833 --> 00:09:19.708
<c.Subtitle-C138_1>That feels so good!

00:09:20.000 --> 00:09:21.208
<c.Subtitle-C139_1>Puffy!

00:09:21.708 --> 00:09:23.583
<c.Subtitle-C140_1>What? That's puffy, too?

00:09:23.625 --> 00:09:24.375
<c.Subtitle-C141_1>Yeah.

00:09:24.416 --> 00:09:27.375
<c.Subtitle-C142_1>They're not as puffy as Ai's boobies.

00:09:27.416 --> 00:09:30.458
<c.Subtitle-C143_1>But they're much softer

00:09:27.417 --> 00:09:30.458
<c.Subtitle-C143_2>than your boobies, Mai.

00:09:31.000 --> 00:09:31.958
<c.Subtitle-C144_1>Hey!

00:09:31.958 --> 00:09:34.708
<c.Subtitle-C145_1>Don't compare my breasts to a frog!

00:09:38.625 --> 00:09:40.500
<c.Subtitle-C146_1>Oh, that's right.

00:09:40.875 --> 00:09:43.625
<c.Subtitle-C147_1>You're not able to swim,

00:09:40.876 --> 00:09:43.625
<c.Subtitle-C147_2>are you, Unagi?

00:09:44.291 --> 00:09:45.291
<c.Subtitle-C148_1>Poor thing.

00:09:45.333 --> 00:09:47.958
<c.Subtitle-C149_1>Ai!

00:09:50.541 --> 00:09:53.333
<c.Subtitle-C150_1>Everyone was so excited

00:09:50.542 --> 00:09:53.333
<c.Subtitle-C150_2>to see those pictures!

00:09:53.375 --> 00:09:56.250
<c.Subtitle-C151_1>And Asuka was happy, too.

00:09:58.000 --> 00:09:58.958
<c.Subtitle-C152_1>I see.

00:09:59.000 --> 00:10:01.083
<c.Subtitle-C153_1>I'm glad to hear that.

00:10:01.541 --> 00:10:03.458
<c.Subtitle-C154_1>Huh? Uh, right.

00:10:03.500 --> 00:10:06.000
<c.Subtitle-C155_1>And I was wondering

00:10:03.501 --> 00:10:06.000
<c.Subtitle-C155_2>if I could take more.

00:10:06.041 --> 00:10:07.708
<c.Subtitle-C156_1>Hold it!

00:10:10.625 --> 00:10:12.791
<c.Subtitle-C157_1>It's Puffy Cheeks!

00:10:13.625 --> 00:10:16.791
<c.Subtitle-C158_1>Hey! Get away from me! Stop it!

00:10:19.291 --> 00:10:22.500
<c.Subtitle-C159_1>Puffy lost against Flat.

00:10:22.750 --> 00:10:25.750
<c.Subtitle-C160_1>Who're you saying is flat?!

00:10:25.750 --> 00:10:26.750
<c.Subtitle-C161_1>Daichi.

00:10:27.083 --> 00:10:27.875
<c.Subtitle-C162_1>Yes?

00:10:27.875 --> 00:10:31.541
<c.Subtitle-C163_1>Do you think you can join us

00:10:27.876 --> 00:10:31.541
<c.Subtitle-C163_2>this afternoon?

00:10:31.541 --> 00:10:35.000
<c.Subtitle-C164_1>Then you can take your

00:10:31.542 --> 00:10:35.000
<c.Subtitle-C164_2>pictures afterwards.

00:10:36.500 --> 00:10:39.500
<c.Subtitle-C165_1>It's all about give and take.

00:10:50.416 --> 00:10:51.333
<c.Subtitle-C166_1>Popotan.

00:10:51.958 --> 00:10:53.166
<c.Caption-C5_1>Mii's Place

00:10:53.166 --> 00:10:55.541
<c.Caption-C6_1>Mii's Place

00:10:53.167 --> 00:10:55.541
<c.Caption-C6_2>Merry Popotan

00:10:53.666 --> 00:10:55.541
<c.Subtitle-C167_1>A Christmas store?

00:10:55.791 --> 00:10:58.083
<c.Subtitle-C168_1>A store with all sorts

00:10:55.792 --> 00:10:58.083
<c.Subtitle-C168_2>of Christmas decorations.

00:10:58.125 --> 00:11:01.833
<c.Subtitle-C169_1>That's why it's always

00:10:58.126 --> 00:11:01.833
<c.Subtitle-C169_2>Christmas at my house.

00:11:01.958 --> 00:11:03.458
<c.Subtitle-C170_1>Daichi...

00:11:03.500 --> 00:11:07.833
<c.Subtitle-C171_1>...I want you and Asuka to

00:11:03.501 --> 00:11:07.833
<c.Subtitle-C171_2>come and shop here.

00:11:07.875 --> 00:11:09.541
<c.Subtitle-C172_1>We'll give you a good deal.

00:11:09.583 --> 00:11:12.083
<c.Subtitle-C173_1>A good deal?

00:11:12.083 --> 00:11:14.291
<c.Subtitle-C174_1>I'll give you a good deal, too.

00:11:14.291 --> 00:11:16.166
<c.Subtitle-C175_1>A good deal, I say.

00:11:17.291 --> 00:11:19.333
<c.Subtitle-C176_1>Hang on tight!

00:11:33.666 --> 00:11:34.875
<c.Subtitle-C177_1>Popotan?

00:11:36.708 --> 00:11:38.083
<c.Subtitle-C178_1>Yeah. Popotan.

00:11:38.083 --> 00:11:40.250
<c.Subtitle-C179_1>We're off to find popotan now.

00:11:40.250 --> 00:11:41.333
<c.Subtitle-C180_1>Come with us.

00:11:41.750 --> 00:11:44.833
<c.Subtitle-C181_1>Sure, but what is this "popotan"?

00:11:45.166 --> 00:11:46.958
<c.Subtitle-C182_1>This is popotan.

00:11:48.083 --> 00:11:49.625
<c.Subtitle-C183_1>Huh? Isn't this tanpopo?

00:11:49.625 --> 00:11:51.625
<c.Subtitle-C184_1>No, po-po-tan!

00:11:52.125 --> 00:11:56.791
<c.Subtitle-C185_1>We like to call tanpopo "popotan".

00:11:56.833 --> 00:11:58.000
<c.Subtitle-C186_1>Daichi...

00:11:58.000 --> 00:12:00.666
<c.Subtitle-C187_1>...do you know where we can find

00:11:58.001 --> 00:12:00.666
<c.Subtitle-C187_2>lots more around here?

00:12:01.208 --> 00:12:03.708
<c.Subtitle-C188_1>Sure, but why do you want tanpopo?

00:12:03.708 --> 00:12:06.500
<c.Subtitle-C189_1>It's popotan! Popotan!

00:12:07.208 --> 00:12:08.541
<c.Subtitle-C190_1>Popotan.

00:12:08.708 --> 00:12:10.250
<c.Subtitle-C191_1>That's very good!

00:12:11.000 --> 00:12:12.500
<c.Subtitle-C192_1>Popotan, huh?

00:12:12.875 --> 00:12:14.166
<c.Subtitle-C193_1>There's popotan!

00:12:14.583 --> 00:12:16.791
<c.Subtitle-C194_1>There's lots! Popotan everywhere!

00:12:16.833 --> 00:12:18.125
<c.Subtitle-C195_1>Let's see. Let's see.

00:12:35.000 --> 00:12:36.833
<c.Subtitle-C196_1>So much space.

00:12:36.875 --> 00:12:38.416
<c.Subtitle-C197_1>I'm sure here we can...

00:12:38.583 --> 00:12:40.166
<c.Subtitle-C198_1>You can what?

00:12:40.333 --> 00:12:42.666
<c.Subtitle-C199_1>Uh, nothing.

00:12:43.916 --> 00:12:45.000
<c.Subtitle-C200_1>Let's go.

00:12:47.666 --> 00:12:50.625
<c.Subtitle-C201_1>Ai, hurry up!

00:12:51.041 --> 00:12:52.958
<c.Subtitle-C202_1>Come on! Daichi, too!

00:12:54.125 --> 00:12:55.750
<c.Subtitle-C203_1>Puffy!

00:12:56.333 --> 00:12:59.041
<c.Subtitle-C204_1>Puffy! Puffy!

00:12:59.166 --> 00:13:01.416
<c.Subtitle-C205_1>Careful, Mii!

00:13:01.583 --> 00:13:04.125
<c.Subtitle-C206_1>Just let go!

00:13:01.584 --> 00:13:04.125
<c.Subtitle-C206_2>Puffy! Puffy!

00:13:07.000 --> 00:13:08.375
<c.Subtitle-C207_1>Hello.

00:13:08.625 --> 00:13:11.875
<c.Subtitle-C208_1>Could we have a little chat?

00:13:19.083 --> 00:13:21.291
<c.Subtitle-C209_1>Hey! Wake up! You'll get fat!

00:13:21.333 --> 00:13:22.750
<c.Subtitle-C210_1>You'll turn into a pig!

00:13:22.791 --> 00:13:25.125
<c.Subtitle-C211_1>Let's go! Puffy cow!

00:13:39.208 --> 00:13:40.791
<c.Subtitle-C212_1>Go!

00:13:48.958 --> 00:13:52.000
<c.Subtitle-C213_1>Oh, is that right?

00:13:52.041 --> 00:13:52.875
<c.Subtitle-C214_1>Yes?

00:13:53.083 --> 00:13:53.833
<c.Subtitle-C215_1>Right.

00:13:54.250 --> 00:13:55.708
<c.Subtitle-C216_1>Oh, I see.

00:13:56.916 --> 00:13:58.041
<c.Subtitle-C217_1>Um, Ai?

00:13:59.375 --> 00:14:00.625
<c.Subtitle-C218_1>What is it?

00:14:00.625 --> 00:14:02.958
<c.Subtitle-C219_1>What are you doing here?

00:14:02.958 --> 00:14:04.875
<c.Subtitle-C220_1>I'm having a chat.

00:14:05.875 --> 00:14:07.000
<c.Subtitle-C221_1>With who?

00:14:07.000 --> 00:14:09.750
<c.Subtitle-C222_1>With the popotan, of course.

00:14:09.750 --> 00:14:11.125
<c.Subtitle-C223_1>Popotan?

00:14:11.250 --> 00:14:14.125
<c.Subtitle-C224_1>All flowers talk, you know.

00:14:14.375 --> 00:14:17.041
<c.Subtitle-C225_1>It's just that you can't hear them

00:14:14.376 --> 00:14:17.041
<c.Subtitle-C225_2>with your ears.

00:14:22.541 --> 00:14:23.958
<c.Subtitle-C226_1>I see.

00:14:24.916 --> 00:14:26.416
<c.Subtitle-C227_1>Thank you.

00:14:26.583 --> 00:14:29.916
<c.Subtitle-C228_1>All right, then.

00:14:26.584 --> 00:14:29.916
<c.Subtitle-C228_2>We'll just have to ask others.

00:14:34.416 --> 00:14:35.541
<c.Subtitle-C229_1>Puffy!

00:14:36.458 --> 00:14:39.208
<c.Subtitle-C230_1>Get out of the way, Daichi!

00:14:39.250 --> 00:14:41.083
<c.Subtitle-C231_1>Move! Move! Move!

00:14:41.125 --> 00:14:43.333
<c.Subtitle-C232_1>Puffy!

00:14:41.126 --> 00:14:43.333
<c.Subtitle-C232_2>Watch it, Daichi!

00:14:43.833 --> 00:14:45.083
<c.Subtitle-C233_1>Hello.

00:14:45.500 --> 00:14:48.208
<c.Subtitle-C234_1>I'd like to have a little chat.

00:14:49.083 --> 00:14:50.000
<c.Subtitle-C235_1>Yes.

00:14:52.250 --> 00:14:53.375
<c.Subtitle-C236_1>Lunchtime!

00:14:53.416 --> 00:14:56.250
<c.Subtitle-C237_1>I love the lunches Mea makes!

00:14:56.541 --> 00:14:59.458
<c.Subtitle-C238_1>No, I made that lunch.

00:15:01.250 --> 00:15:02.750
<c.Subtitle-C239_1>What's the matter?

00:15:03.083 --> 00:15:04.791
<c.Subtitle-C240_1>Can I have some, Ai?

00:15:05.083 --> 00:15:07.541
<c.Subtitle-C241_1>Sure. Have as much as you want.

00:15:11.041 --> 00:15:12.541
<c.Subtitle-C242_1>Thanks for the food!

00:15:23.416 --> 00:15:25.541
<c.Subtitle-C243_1>I'm scared.

00:15:25.791 --> 00:15:28.791
<c.Subtitle-C244_1>No creature has managed

00:15:25.792 --> 00:15:28.791
<c.Subtitle-C244_2>to survive after eating...

00:15:28.791 --> 00:15:30.791
<c.Subtitle-C245_1>...something that Ai made.

00:15:31.041 --> 00:15:33.875
<c.Subtitle-C246_1>What? Is that right?

00:15:37.625 --> 00:15:39.291
<c.Subtitle-C247_1>But it's so good!

00:15:39.291 --> 00:15:41.958
<c.Subtitle-C248_1>You can't taste anything, Ai.

00:15:42.000 --> 00:15:44.250
<c.Subtitle-C249_1>Just look at Daichi.

00:15:48.250 --> 00:15:49.583
<c.Subtitle-C250_1>I'm so sorry.

00:15:50.000 --> 00:15:52.208
<c.Subtitle-C251_1>Th-that's not true.

00:15:53.500 --> 00:15:54.875
<c.Subtitle-C252_1>It's really good.

00:15:54.875 --> 00:15:58.375
<c.Subtitle-C253_1>It tastes a little unusual,

00:15:54.876 --> 00:15:58.375
<c.Subtitle-C253_2>so I was just caught off guard.

00:16:01.375 --> 00:16:02.500
<c.Subtitle-C254_1>Delicious!

00:16:02.500 --> 00:16:03.916
<c.Subtitle-C255_1>Oh, Daichi!

00:16:04.291 --> 00:16:07.208
<c.Subtitle-C256_1>Daichi, you're a good guy.

00:16:07.250 --> 00:16:08.083
<c.Subtitle-C257_1>Yes.

00:16:08.333 --> 00:16:12.333
<c.Subtitle-C258_1>That's my Puffy Cheeks for you!

00:16:12.666 --> 00:16:13.625
<c.Subtitle-C259_1>All right.

00:16:13.625 --> 00:16:16.708
<c.Subtitle-C260_1>I'll play the ghost today.

00:16:16.750 --> 00:16:20.833
<c.Subtitle-C261_1>It'll end up looking more like

00:16:16.751 --> 00:16:20.833
<c.Subtitle-C261_2>a crazy female wrestler.

00:16:20.833 --> 00:16:22.583
<c.Subtitle-C262_1>Did you say something, Mii?!

00:16:22.583 --> 00:16:27.291
<c.Subtitle-C263_1>I never said you'd turn into

00:16:22.584 --> 00:16:27.291
<c.Subtitle-C263_2>a wrestling monster woman.

00:16:27.708 --> 00:16:29.041
<c.Subtitle-C264_1>Mii!

00:16:51.916 --> 00:16:53.250
<c.Subtitle-C265_1>This is...

00:16:55.000 --> 00:16:57.125
<c.Subtitle-C266_1>Wow!

00:16:57.875 --> 00:16:59.958
<c.Subtitle-C267_1>This is...

00:17:00.000 --> 00:17:01.625
<c.Subtitle-C268_1>...oh, over here!

00:17:01.666 --> 00:17:04.958
<c.Subtitle-C269_1>I knew ghosts were real.

00:17:06.083 --> 00:17:07.416
<c.Subtitle-C270_1>Thank goodness.

00:17:07.583 --> 00:17:09.791
<c.Subtitle-C271_1>You like ghosts?

00:17:09.833 --> 00:17:11.708
<c.Subtitle-C272_1>Uh, no.

00:17:11.875 --> 00:17:15.416
<c.Subtitle-C273_1>I happened to see the ghost

00:17:11.876 --> 00:17:15.416
<c.Subtitle-C273_2>of my dead mother...

00:17:15.416 --> 00:17:17.083
<c.Subtitle-C274_1>...on my birthday recently.

00:17:18.583 --> 00:17:22.416
<c.Subtitle-C275_1>I figured that she came to see me...

00:17:22.416 --> 00:17:25.375
<c.Subtitle-C276_1>...but everyone said ghosts aren't real.

00:17:25.416 --> 00:17:28.708
<c.Subtitle-C277_1>But thanks to you, Daichi,

00:17:25.417 --> 00:17:28.708
<c.Subtitle-C277_2>I now know they exist!

00:17:28.875 --> 00:17:30.333
<c.Subtitle-C278_1>Uh, but...

00:17:30.333 --> 00:17:32.541
<c.Subtitle-C279_1>Thank you, Daichi.

00:17:32.625 --> 00:17:34.708
<c.Subtitle-C280_1>Actually...

00:17:34.750 --> 00:17:37.041
<c.Subtitle-C281_1>Daichi, what's the matter?

00:17:37.041 --> 00:17:38.583
<c.Subtitle-C282_1>Don't be fooled.

00:17:38.958 --> 00:17:41.708
<c.Subtitle-C283_1>There are no such things as ghosts.

00:17:41.750 --> 00:17:45.916
<c.Subtitle-C284_1>I happened to see this

00:17:41.751 --> 00:17:45.916
<c.Subtitle-C284_2>under Daichi's desk.

00:17:45.958 --> 00:17:46.708
<c.Subtitle-C285_1>See.

00:17:53.125 --> 00:17:56.125
<c.Subtitle-C286_1>Asuka, there's an explanation for this.

00:17:57.666 --> 00:18:00.375
<c.Subtitle-C287_1>They do exist, right?

00:18:01.083 --> 00:18:02.708
<c.Subtitle-C288_1>Well, uh...

00:18:21.250 --> 00:18:23.666
<c.Subtitle-C289_1>Keep ticking, old clock.

00:18:31.666 --> 00:18:32.666
<c.Subtitle-C290_1>Uh...

00:18:32.875 --> 00:18:37.291
<c.Subtitle-C291_1>Miss Ai, Miss Mai and

00:18:32.876 --> 00:18:37.291
<c.Subtitle-C291_2>Miss Mii are all out today.

00:18:37.333 --> 00:18:38.125
<c.Subtitle-C292_1>Huh?

00:18:38.291 --> 00:18:39.958
<c.Subtitle-C293_1>Please leave.

00:18:57.625 --> 00:18:58.791
<c.Subtitle-C294_1>Please wait!

00:19:03.500 --> 00:19:04.583
<c.Subtitle-C295_1>Ai.

00:19:04.583 --> 00:19:06.250
<c.Subtitle-C296_1>What's the matter?

00:19:06.500 --> 00:19:09.333
<c.Subtitle-C297_1>Um, well...

00:19:22.000 --> 00:19:23.833
<c.Subtitle-C298_1>We don't have any time left.

00:19:23.833 --> 00:19:26.916
<c.Subtitle-C299_1>Why are you letting him in the house?

00:19:27.916 --> 00:19:30.916
<c.Subtitle-C300_1>You need to give me more time.

00:19:32.125 --> 00:19:34.291
<c.Subtitle-C301_1>Well, if that's what you want.

00:19:35.000 --> 00:19:37.250
<c.Subtitle-C302_1>Mea, get us some tea.

00:19:37.250 --> 00:19:38.791
<c.Subtitle-C303_1>And call Mii.

00:19:38.791 --> 00:19:41.625
<c.Subtitle-C304_1>Miss Mii has gone to take a bath.

00:19:41.666 --> 00:19:42.833
<c.Subtitle-C305_1>I see.

00:19:44.291 --> 00:19:45.125
<c.Subtitle-C306_1>What?!

00:19:50.250 --> 00:19:53.166
<c.Subtitle-C307_1>In the bath with Puffy Cheeks!

00:20:03.333 --> 00:20:04.500
<c.Subtitle-C308_1>Uh, Ai?

00:20:04.833 --> 00:20:07.125
<c.Subtitle-C309_1>Now, put on your clothes!

00:20:10.083 --> 00:20:11.291
<c.Subtitle-C310_1>I see.

00:20:11.291 --> 00:20:12.666
<c.Subtitle-C311_1>To Asuka?

00:20:13.833 --> 00:20:14.833
<c.Subtitle-C312_1>Yes.

00:20:21.333 --> 00:20:24.208
<c.Subtitle-C313_1>The popotan were telling me

00:20:21.334 --> 00:20:24.208
<c.Subtitle-C313_2>just yesterday...

00:20:24.208 --> 00:20:28.291
<c.Subtitle-C314_1>...that there were finally people

00:20:24.209 --> 00:20:28.291
<c.Subtitle-C314_2>who could hear them.

00:20:30.083 --> 00:20:34.208
<c.Subtitle-C315_1>It's difficult to accept and

00:20:30.084 --> 00:20:34.208
<c.Subtitle-C315_2>understand things...

00:20:34.208 --> 00:20:35.791
<c.Subtitle-C316_1>...that you can't see or hear.

00:20:36.416 --> 00:20:39.541
<c.Subtitle-C317_1>But things like that do exist.

00:20:41.125 --> 00:20:47.333
<c.Subtitle-C318_1>When you ate my sandwich

00:20:41.126 --> 00:20:47.333
<c.Subtitle-C318_2>and said it was delicious...

00:20:47.333 --> 00:20:50.916
<c.Subtitle-C319_1>...I felt the kindness that went

00:20:47.334 --> 00:20:50.916
<c.Subtitle-C319_2>along with your words.

00:20:51.791 --> 00:20:55.958
<c.Subtitle-C320_1>You took those pictures because

00:20:51.792 --> 00:20:55.958
<c.Subtitle-C320_2>you wanted to help someone...

00:20:55.958 --> 00:21:00.375
<c.Subtitle-C321_1>...and the feelings expressed

00:20:55.959 --> 00:21:00.375
<c.Subtitle-C321_2>were not something you can see.

00:21:03.375 --> 00:21:07.708
<c.Subtitle-C322_1>It's not easy to recognize

00:21:03.376 --> 00:21:07.708
<c.Subtitle-C322_2>how others feel at times.

00:21:08.541 --> 00:21:10.208
<c.Subtitle-C323_1>But I believe in them.

00:21:10.208 --> 00:21:12.375
<c.Subtitle-C324_1>I know that the feelings

00:21:10.209 --> 00:21:12.375
<c.Subtitle-C324_2>will come across.

00:21:15.541 --> 00:21:16.583
<c.Subtitle-C325_1>Uh...

00:21:17.125 --> 00:21:18.125
<c.Subtitle-C326_1>Yes?

00:21:19.833 --> 00:21:22.333
<c.Subtitle-C327_1>Who are you people, Ai?

00:21:23.916 --> 00:21:26.041
<c.Subtitle-C328_1>I wonder.

00:21:27.750 --> 00:21:28.916
<c.Subtitle-C329_1>Thank you.

00:21:29.375 --> 00:21:34.041
<c.Subtitle-C330_1>It was the first time that anyone

00:21:29.376 --> 00:21:34.041
<c.Subtitle-C330_2>said my food was good.

00:22:42.583 --> 00:22:43.958
<c.Subtitle-C331_1>How pretty!

00:22:50.625 --> 00:22:51.916
<c.Subtitle-C332_1>Are ghosts...

00:22:53.375 --> 00:22:55.833
<c.Subtitle-C333_1>Are ghosts for real?

00:22:58.541 --> 00:22:59.750
<c.Subtitle-C334_1>I'm sure they are.

00:23:00.291 --> 00:23:01.208
<c.Subtitle-C335_1>Yeah.

00:23:01.208 --> 00:23:03.000
<c.Subtitle-C336_1>Do you still have those pictures?

00:23:03.000 --> 00:23:03.791
<c.Subtitle-C337_1>Yeah.

00:23:06.583 --> 00:23:08.083
<c.Subtitle-C338_1>What? What's the matter?

00:23:08.125 --> 00:23:09.291
<c.Subtitle-C339_1>I-It's nothing.

00:23:09.500 --> 00:23:11.375
<c.Subtitle-C340_1>Something's fishy.

00:23:11.375 --> 00:23:12.041
<c.Subtitle-C341_1>Let's see!

00:23:12.041 --> 00:23:13.458
<c.Subtitle-C342_1>I said it's nothing!

00:23:13.500 --> 00:23:14.833
<c.Subtitle-C343_1>Let's see! Let's see!

00:23:13.501 --> 00:23:14.833
<c.Subtitle-C343_2>It's nothing!

00:23:41.291 --> 00:23:44.708
<c.Caption-C7_1>I want to love you in technopunk

00:23:44.708 --> 00:23:48.083
<c.Caption-C8_1>I transmit my love through the airwaves

00:23:48.083 --> 00:23:51.625
<c.Caption-C9_1>I want to be romantic with you

00:23:51.625 --> 00:23:53.208
<c.Caption-C10_1>I want you to laugh

00:23:53.208 --> 00:23:54.916
<c.Caption-C11_1>I love, love, love you

00:23:54.916 --> 00:23:58.416
<c.Caption-C12_1>S.U.K.I. Thump thump love

00:23:58.416 --> 00:24:01.875
<c.Caption-C13_1>S.U.K.I. Gimme gimme kiss

00:24:01.875 --> 00:24:05.375
<c.Caption-C14_1>S.U.K.I. Suki suki love

00:24:05.375 --> 00:24:09.000
<c.Caption-C15_1>S.U.K.I. You love me? Kiss

00:24:09.000 --> 00:24:10.750
<c.Caption-C16_1>Round and round

00:24:10.750 --> 00:24:12.500
<c.Caption-C17_1>The needle of the time-space clock

00:24:12.500 --> 00:24:16.000
<c.Caption-C18_1>Points to our star charts

00:24:16.000 --> 00:24:19.333
<c.Caption-C19_1>The secret of love is revealed

00:24:19.333 --> 00:24:23.916
<c.Caption-C20_1>I want to know more about

00:24:19.334 --> 00:24:23.916
<c.Caption-C20_2>what makes my heart go thump thump

00:24:26.208 --> 00:24:30.791
<c.Caption-C21_1>If every boy and every girl

00:24:26.209 --> 00:24:30.791
<c.Caption-C21_2>believed in miracles

00:24:33.000 --> 00:24:37.791
<c.Caption-C22_1>We'd be sure to find

00:24:33.001 --> 00:24:37.791
<c.Caption-C22_2>the berry, berry strawberry day

00:24:40.125 --> 00:24:46.166
<c.Caption-C23_1>I'll be fine even if we have to

00:24:40.126 --> 00:24:46.166
<c.Caption-C23_2>say goodbye one day

00:24:46.166 --> 00:24:50.875
<c.Caption-C24_1>I still want to tell you just how I love you

00:24:50.916 --> 00:24:54.041
<c.Caption-C25_1>I love you! I, I love you!

00:24:55.458 --> 00:24:59.583
<c.Subtitle-C344_1>Transform! Una!

00:25:10.458 --> 00:25:14.333
<c.Subtitle-C345_1>Well, was I cute in that episode?

00:25:15.500 --> 00:25:32.666
<c.Caption-C26_1>Friends

00:25:17.375 --> 00:25:20.541
<c.Subtitle-C346_1>Okay, the next episode

00:25:17.376 --> 00:25:20.541
<c.Subtitle-C346_2>of Popotan is "Friends".

00:25:20.583 --> 00:25:22.750
<c.Subtitle-C347_1>Now that I've introduced

00:25:20.584 --> 00:25:22.750
<c.Subtitle-C347_2>the next episode...

00:25:22.750 --> 00:25:24.833
<c.Subtitle-C348_1>...I've got the rest of this time

00:25:22.751 --> 00:25:24.833
<c.Subtitle-C348_2>for myself!

00:25:24.833 --> 00:25:28.250
<c.Subtitle-C349_1>It's time for Unagi's

00:25:24.834 --> 00:25:28.250
<c.Subtitle-C349_2>"What's-What News Service".

00:25:28.250 --> 00:25:31.250
<c.Subtitle-C350_1>Hey, this is where

00:25:28.251 --> 00:25:31.250
<c.Subtitle-C350_2>I'm supposed to come on-screen!

00:25:31.250 --> 00:25:33.125
<c.Subtitle-C351_1>But there's no time!

00:25:36.791 --> 00:25:38.958
<c.Subtitle-C352_1>Good night, everyone!
